flowchart TD
    a["One collection, one compact PAX object"]
    b{"Requested search mode"}
    c["Adaptive checks f32 eligibility, row count<br/>and rows × dimensions × 4 against scan budget"]
    d["Exact<br/>Read full object and score every eligible f32 vector"]
    e["ANN<br/>Select IVF cells and quantized candidates"]
